{"3135990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Finnish Cabin Mayhem - Mökkimähinä", "steam_appid": 3135990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alcohol. Action. Violence. Get ready to take your friends &quot;behind the sauna&quot;.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finnish Cabin Mayhem aims to provide an old school arcade shooter experience with a focus on chaotic melee combat. Use whatever there is at hand as a weapon to clubber your enemies in numerous different levels and game modes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alcohol infused multiplayer madness </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy various alcoholic beverages and beat the opposition with complex martial art techniques. Loot and utilize various improvised weapons such as sausages, baseball bats and pellet guns.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135990/extras/64350d49fc5d3e62034aba03c04179a8.poster.avif?t=1775941343\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135990/extras/64350d49fc5d3e62034aba03c04179a8.webm?t=1775941343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135990/extras/64350d49fc5d3e62034aba03c04179a8.mp4?t=1775941343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-octane action in multiple environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive bikes, plant mines, go to sauna and fire disposable rocket launchers. Gain access to ancient mythical weapons hidden in the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3135990/e